        "title": "The charts below show the reasons for immigrants to and from a European country in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant. ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The charts below show the reasons for immigrants to and from a European country in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.&nbsp;</strong></em></p>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<p><em><strong>The charts below show the reasons for immigrants to and from a European country in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.&nbsp;</strong></em></p>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Reasons for immigrants and emigrants in a European country in 2009</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrDFdCeWqoFwNXxm6XmlZe9tgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NmfLdT37Dos7wjxDn8jlfBrmgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Reasons for immigrants and emigrants in a European country in 2009 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh c&aacute;c l&yacute; do khiến người di cư đến v&agrave; khỏi một quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u trong năm 2009.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kiepdrr3QorzRMxEyXblNllBg8g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JCGpd1foto64nyxhzkalvvNggUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Reasons for immigrants and emigrants in a European country in 2009 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm/tỷ lệ - c&aacute;c l&iacute; do - người nhập cư v&agrave; xuất cư - ở một quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u - năm 2009.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PQjhdrejFoArznxOBHJl5DuRgUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Pie Charts</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng PIE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VJSld276foIK5bxd5QMlicjyg7A\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: \"Having a definite job\"&nbsp;</strong>l&agrave; l&iacute; do ch&iacute;nh cho <strong>emigrants</strong>, trong khi&nbsp;<strong>Accompany/Family&nbsp;</strong>l&agrave; l&iacute; do chiếm đa số đối với <strong>immigrants.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4k6dA1a4oXiEWxyS5RlFN0ggPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences:</strong> C&aacute;c l&iacute; do li&ecirc;n quan tới <strong>Work</strong> v&agrave; <strong>Study</strong> chiếm tỷ lệ lớn hơn trong <strong>emigration </strong>so với <strong>immigration</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IObAdsQ0WoBv58x886slUinzgBe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Definite job, Look for job v&agrave; Study</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VvZZdaqNgoFctqxUSsKlarX1gBl\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R32kdL6V5omUyWxJeeLlgpZMglf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh l&iacute; do Definite job giữa immigrants v&agrave; emigrants (38% emigrant</strong>s rời đi v&igrave; c&oacute; Definite job, cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với 23% <strong>immigrants)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YCJndm3XioNn0axHTMgl6WiSghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh l&iacute; do Look for job giữa immigrants v&agrave; emigrants</strong>&nbsp;<em>(15% immigrants nhập cư với l&iacute; do Look for job, cao hơn một ch&uacute;t so với 13% emigrants)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YCJndm3XioNn0axHTMgl6WiSghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh l&iacute; do Study giữa immigrants v&agrave; emigrants</strong><em><strong> </strong>(15% immigrants nhập cư với l&iacute; do Study, gấp đ&ocirc;i 7% emigrants)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gbhwdc2V3oFSzGxBYxyl0tUigK6\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Accompany/Family, Other reasons v&agrave; No reasons</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FC13dND0AoPAxBxr1ImlqZgpg83\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5HhdDJVYoqxV2xWzqGlt0Oigsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <em><strong>So s&aacute;nh l&iacute; do Accompany/Family giữa immigrants v&agrave; emigrants&nbsp;</strong></em><em>(25% immigrants nhập cư v&igrave; l&iacute; do Accompany/Family, cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với 15% emigrants)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X8ERd0uggoUi7AxJwSTlqpaugug\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <em><strong>So s&aacute;nh Other reasons giữa immigrants v&agrave; emigrants</strong></em>&nbsp;<em>(15% immigrants nhập cư v&igrave; Other reasons, thấp hơn một ch&uacute;t so với 17% emigrants)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X8ERd0uggoUi7AxJwSTlqpaugug\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3)<em> <strong>So s&aacute;nh No reasons giữa immigrants v&agrave; emigrants&nbsp;</strong>(No reasons chiếm tỉ lệ nhỏ với 7% immigrants v&agrave; 4% emigrants)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B5Mrdgy4zoH6zvxmR7Nloz5qgKe\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>immigrants/emigrants\"</strong>, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; những c&aacute;ch paraphrase như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vvc4d1BitoVp0zxI0avlY4NggR6\" data-list=\"bullet\">immigrants = immigrate (v) to = those arriving&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z1ojdehggoYOcYxVJQRlYWtpgze\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>emigrants = emigrate (v) from = those leaving the country</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TtowdzxbvoQnzFxcJZzl76B3g7b\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BH0gdZM5zoKLt5xAVTbljEbZg1e\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wzt7dRFGVoH6EoxoX03lRY4egkq\">The pie charts compare the proportions of various reasons why people <strong>immigrated to</strong> and <strong>emigrated from</strong> a European nation in 2009.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wzt7dRFGVoH6EoxoX03lRY4egkq\">Overall, having a definite job was the primary motivation for <strong>those leaving the country</strong>, while family-related reasons were most common among <strong>those arriving</strong>.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2635,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jo3Qd5tDeo4z7BxqULolX3JSgHb\">The pie charts compare the proportions of various reasons why people immigrated to and emigrated from a European nation in 2009.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24855,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2636,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBh8d6YwAoHrdtxXZwzl7kr9g0d\">Overall, having a definite job was the primary motivation for those leaving the country, while family-related reasons were most common among those arriving. Additionally, work and study collectively accounted for a larger share of emigration than immigration.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24855,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2637,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BjQxdJenGoQQb0xMjrVlXuZOgxc\">Regarding professional and educational motivations, 38% of emigrants left with a confirmed job offer, which was significantly higher than 23% of immigrants arriving for the same reason. In terms of job-seeking, those moving to the country accounted for 15%, marginally exceeding 13% of those departing. Meanwhile, study represented 15% of arrivals, more than double the 7% recorded for departures.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24855,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2638,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BJkuddvAAorCA7xk155l43BWgLf\">As for personal factors, accompanying family members was cited by a quarter of immigrants, substantially more than 15% of emigrants leaving for this purpose. By con, only 15% of people moving to this country said that they did so for other unspecified reasons, slightly lower compared to 17% of emigrants. Finally, the percentage of people with no stated reason remained relatively minor in both groups, at 7% for immigrants and 4% for emigrants.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24855,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
